## 4. Student Pages List

1. **Student Dashboard / Quest Map Page** (`/student/dashboard`)  
   *Main interactive hub matching the reference designs: Today's Adventure hero, 4 learning action cards, quest map sidebar, character collection, and floating AI tutor bar.*
2. **Course & Curriculum Overview Page** (`/student/courses`)  
   *Browse all math modules by grade, chapter progress, and locked/unlocked topics.*
3. **Lesson Player Page** (`/student/lesson/[id]`)  
   *Interactive learning view containing EduNotes reading mode, video lesson player, 3D interactive concept widgets, and in-lesson AI tutor assistant.*
4. **Practice & Quiz Page** (`/student/quiz/[id]`)  
   *Gamified practice environment with multiple choice questions, timer, XP rewards, graduated AI hints, and score summaries.*
5. **Worksheets Page** (`/student/worksheets`)  
   *List of assigned/downloadable practice worksheets with submission tracking.*
6. **Gamification & Rewards Hub Page** (`/student/rewards`)  
   *Daily/weekly missions list, badge showcase, streak calendar, gem store, and expanded character collection.*
7. **Leaderboard Page** (`/student/leaderboard`)  
   *Real-time student rankings (Weekly, Monthly, All-time) with podium presentation, classmate scores, and XP reward tiers.*
8. **Student Profile & Achievements Page** (`/student/profile`)  
   *Student profile bio, avatar customizer, earned achievements wall, and study statistics.*

---

## 5. Teacher Pages List

1. **Teacher Dashboard Overview** (`/teacher/dashboard`)  
   *Overview of overall class health, average test scores, student completion rates, recent activities, and at-risk student alerts.*
2. **Class & Roster Management Page** (`/teacher/classes`)  
   *Manage class sections, view student rosters, inspect individual student learning stats, and access parent contact info.*
3. **Class Performance & Analytics Page** (`/teacher/analytics`)  
   *Comprehensive analytics breakdown with topic performance heatmaps, grade distributions, and downloadable progress reports.*
4. **Assignment & Worksheet Manager Page** (`/teacher/assignments`)  
   *Create, schedule, and assign custom practice worksheets and quizzes to specific classes or students.*
5. **AI Lesson Planner Page** (`/teacher/ai-planner`)  
   *AI-assisted lesson plan generator for creating curriculum-aligned teaching plans, quiz questions, and exercise sets.*
6. **Teacher Profile & Settings Page** (`/teacher/profile`)  
   *Manage teacher credentials, assigned classes, subject preferences, and notification settings.*

